# OCR production assets and catalog data are SHA-256 pinned; Git must never rewrite
# their line endings or the runtime integrity checks will fail.
assets/ocr/PP-OCRv5_mobile_rec.onnx binary
assets/ocr/ppocrv5_dict.txt binary
crates/ptt-catalog/data/** binary
tests/screenshots/*.png binary
tests/screenshots/*.jpg binary

# The app icon is handed to rc.exe verbatim at build time. Git's binary
# heuristic happens to guess right on an .ico, but core.autocrlf is on in this
# repo and a guess that ever goes the other way costs the exe its icon with no
# error louder than a cargo:warning.
crates/ptt-app/assets/icon.ico binary
